ck 12.\\\",\\\"At tick 19 the prepared stack contains three berries and retains original harvest age and ongoing decay.\\\",\\\"The supplied method states unchanged nutrition, toxicity and decay, and does not support mixing different foods or heating.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"No advantage in eating experience has been tested; improved nutrition, preservation and cooking are not effects of this method.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Test the available method and distinguish its demonstrated output from desired improvements.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Requested and learned the supplied cold-combination method.\\\",\\\"Completed a three-berry preparation trial and obtained its resulting stack.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"A carried prepared stack of three berries.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"No additional evidence is needed to establish that this limited method produces a prepared stack; broader cooking remains unavailable through it.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Eat existing prepared berries as hunger warrants rather than repeating preparation without a practical reason.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Demonstrated the preparation workflow and its limits; no nutritional or preservation benefit observed.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"root-cultivation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can a small root cultivation trial help sustain a local food supply?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Four roots harvested from commons-root-5-0 are currently owned.\\\",\\\"A cultivation-trial ability is available to learn but is not yet mastered.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Exact planting requirements, site suitability, establishment and subsequent growth have not been tested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Learn the method and, if feasible, establish one modest trial while retaining food reserves.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Personal learning, full operating requirements, a suitable site and physical trial evidence.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Learn cultivation-trial, inspect its requirements, then decide whether to plant one root.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Potential future local food supply; no cultivation benefit demonstrated yet.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","logprobs":[]}

